    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm running a manufacturing plant out in Ohio and we're getting hit pretty hard by these new carbon emission standards being proposed. I have a meeting with our local rep next week and I need to make a strong case for why these specific regulations are going to hurt us. Can you give me a solid list of the main economic and operational arguments against these new standards? I need stuff that actually carries weight in a policy discussion.",
